  <item>
    <title>06 夏天夏天悄悄过去，留下小秘密</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/60fd34d316d98132bc25800b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">60fd34d316d98132bc25800b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 25 Jul 2021 09:34:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期概述】</span><br><span>不知不觉，夏天已经过了大半。提到夏天，你会想到哪些关键词？空调西瓜冰可乐，或是海鲜烧烤冰啤酒……</span><br><span>本期话题，就让阿鹿和愁哥陪你一起，聊聊夏天的那些专属记忆。</span><br><br><span>主播：愁哥、阿鹿</span><br><br><span>【本期剧透】</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 愁哥夏天的关键词</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 冒汗：公交车上的酸臭味</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="252">04:12</a> 空调：赋予了我夏天的生命</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="325">05:25</a> 西瓜：没有西瓜的夏天不算夏天</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="448">07:28</a> 烧烤：夏天傍晚的烧烤摊</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">08:20</a> 冰可乐：关于冷饮的回忆</span><br><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 阿鹿夏天的关键词</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="635">10:35</a> 雷雨：老家的雷雨和雨后的彩虹</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">13:15</a> 大海：盛大的海会仪式</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a> 毕业：没来得及好好道别</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="944">15:44</a> 墨绿色：连叶子都被晒黑了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> T恤短裤人字拖：夏天的穿衣减负</span><br><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1130">18:50</a> 夏天限定会发生的事情</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1228">20:28</a> 愁哥夏天的倒霉事</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1345">22:25</a> 夏天就是愁哥的春天：万物复苏</span><br><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1460">24:20</a> 夏天的难忘故事</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1470">24:30</a> 阿鹿的上海回忆：破碎的梦与现实</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1640">27:20</a> 愁哥的独居一年：学会和自己独处</span><br><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1823">30:23</a> 今年夏天过得怎么样</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1985">33:05</a> 抓住夏天的尾巴：我们的夏末规划</span><br><br></p><p><span>【找到我们】</span><br><span>小宇宙：@没有答案 No Answer</span><br><span>喜马拉雅：@没有答案 No Answer</span><br><span>Spotify：@没有答案 No Answer</span><br><span>微博@不学无术我也发愁</span><br><span>微信公众号@阿鹿先生</span><br><br><span>如果你有任何想要分享的内容，欢迎留言或私信，与我们取得联系。</span></p>]]></description>
